meta {
  name: Get Tenant Branding
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/tenant/branding
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

docs {
  The caller's own tenant's branding (admin.branding.view). The tenant comes from the
  session, never a parameter. Returns the theme (editable by the tenant admin) and, read-only,
  everything Super Admin sets: terms, nav_overrides, locale_config (regional formats,
  {} = platform default), product_names, the 13 image slots as gateway paths (assets) with
  display facts (asset_meta), and public_key.
}
